# Isshin, Two Heavens as One doubles abilities of permanents its controller controls, whoever's creature is attacking
# (CR 603.2d): Bot2 attacks Bot1 with Hero of Bladehold, and Bot1's Emberwilde Captain ("Whenever an opponent attacks you
# while you're the monarch, this creature deals damage to that player equal to the number of cards in their hand")
# triggers twice. Bot2's own Hero abilities are not Bot1's: they trigger once each, two Soldiers.
# Turn 1: Bot1 casts Isshin (Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl, Mox Jet) and the Captain (Black Lotus RRR and the Mountain), and becomes
# the monarch. Turn 2: Bot2 casts the Hero (Black Lotus WWW and a Plains). Turn 4: Bot2 attacks with the Hero, with five
# cards in hand (7 + 1 drawn - 4 played + 1 drawn), and takes 5 twice.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Isshin, Two Heavens as One
Emberwilde Captain
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Hero of Bladehold
Plains x15

